        "answer": {
          "short": "two, three, no",
          "worked": "The counts one, two and three are mutually exclusive. The only count excluded by ‘at least one’ is zero.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{at least one 5})&=P(\\text{one 5})+P(\\text{two 5s})+P(\\text{three 5s})\\\\P(\\text{at least one 5})&=1-P(\\text{no 5s})\\end{align*}$$",
